  "description": "*“Want to sleep over?”*\n\nChoi Su-Hyeok, the movie star next door, goes full steam ahead from the very first meeting. As a result, Jeong Se-Yeon finds himself swept up in the whirlwind, unable to keep him bearings, and has lost count of how many movies he’s made that blur the line between romance and comedy.\n\nA modern-day romance where a handsome guy meets an even more handsome guy, and both get swept up in the chaos of work and love!\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
